<title>USA: SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT PERU IN U.S. CUP COMPETITION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT PERU IN U.S. CUP COMPETITION.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, California 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark beat Peru</p>
<p>2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a U.S. Cup tournament match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Denmark - Soren Andersen (8th minute), Soren Colding</p>
<p>(81st)</p>
<p>Peru - Nolberto Solano Todco (51st)</p>
</text>
